From: tao3k team and Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] make: project native identities and prioritize shared dependencies

Native default-package identity reads one form, preserving cached imports for
explicit headers and opaque readers. Reuse the actual import graph to order the
existing coordinators by direct consumers; preserve stable declaration ties.
No new queue, worker limit, source omission or dependency-wait path is added.

